@startuml prototype_motivation
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam sequence {
  BackgroundColor LightYellow
  BorderColor DarkSlateGray
  ArrowColor DarkSlateGray
  ActorBackgroundColor LightYellow
  ParticipantBackgroundColor LightYellow
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
}

title Motywacja — koszt tworzenia obiektów

actor "Klient" as KlientL
participant "new ServerConfig()" as C1
database "Serwer / Baza danych" as DB
participant "ServerConfig\n(prototyp)" as Proto
participant "clone()" as Clone
actor "Klient" as KlientP

== Bez Prototypu: każde tworzenie jest kosztowne ==

KlientL -> C1 : request config #1
C1 -> DB : pobierz dane (500 ms)
DB --> C1 : dane
C1 --> KlientL : config #1

KlientL -> C1 : request config #2 (te same dane!)
C1 -> DB : pobierz dane ponownie (500 ms)
DB --> C1 : dane
C1 --> KlientL : config #2

note right
  2 × 500 ms = 1000 ms
  Na 100 kopii = 50 000 ms
end note

== Z Prototypem: klonujemy gotowy obiekt ==

KlientP -> Proto : new ServerConfig() — raz
Proto -> DB : pobierz dane (500 ms)
DB --> Proto : dane
Proto --> KlientP : config #1 (prototyp)

KlientP -> Clone : clone prototypu (< 1 ms)
Clone --> KlientP : config #2 (kopia)

KlientP -> Clone : clone prototypu (< 1 ms)
Clone --> KlientP : config #3 (kopia)

note right
  1 × 500 ms + 99 × < 1 ms
  Na 100 kopii: ~500-600 ms
end note

@enduml
